error[E3074]: recursive generic calls through `grow` grow a type argument without bound
 --> tests/types/fail/E3074_expanding_instantiation.tarn:7:9
  |
7 |         grow(Wrap{v: x}, n - 1)
  |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `T` becomes `Wrap<T>` here
  |
  = note: each turn of the recursion wraps `T` again, so compiling it would need infinitely many copies of `grow`
  = help: pass the growing value behind a non-generic type such as `any Interface`, or keep the type argument unchanged

